{"page":321,"verses":[{"verse_key":"20:126","surah":20,"ayah":126,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ كَذَٰلِكَ أَتَتْكَ ءَايَـٰتُنَا فَنَسِيتَهَا ۖ وَكَذَٰلِكَ ٱلْيَوْمَ تُنسَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God will say, ‘This is how it is: You ignored Our revelations when they came to you, so today you will be ignored.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He will say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَتَتْكَ","en_gloss":"came to you","transliteration":"atatka","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"āyātunā","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَنَسِيتَهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"but you forgot them","transliteration":"fanasītahā","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"and thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُنسَىٰ","en_gloss":"you will be forgotten","transliteration":"tunsā","verse_key":"20:126"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٢٦","en_gloss":"(126)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:126"}]},{"verse_key":"20:127","surah":20,"ayah":127,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِى مَنْ أَسْرَفَ وَلَمْ يُؤْمِنۢ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِۦ ۚ وَلَعَذَابُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ أَشَدُّ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is how We reward those who go too far, and who do not believe in their Lord’s revelations. The greatest and most enduring punishment is in the Hereafter.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَجْزِى","en_gloss":"We recompense","transliteration":"najzī","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"(he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَسْرَفَ","en_gloss":"transgresses","transliteration":"asrafa","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُؤْمِنۢ","en_gloss":"believes","transliteration":"yu'min","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"in (the) Signs","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبِّهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) his Lord","transliteration":"rabbihi","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"And surely (the) punishment","transliteration":"walaʿadhābu","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَشَدُّ","en_gloss":"(is) more severe","transliteration":"ashaddu","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"and more lasting","transliteration":"wa-abqā","verse_key":"20:127"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٢٧","en_gloss":"(127)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:127"}]},{"verse_key":"20:128","surah":20,"ayah":128,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ يَهْدِ لَهُمْ كَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا قَبْلَهُم مِّنَ ٱلْقُرُونِ يَمْشُونَ فِى مَسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۗ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّأُو۟لِى ٱلنُّهَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not draw a lesson from the many generations We destroyed before them, through whose dwelling places they now walk? There truly are signs in this for anyone with understanding!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Then has not","transliteration":"afalam","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَهْدِ","en_gloss":"it guided","transliteration":"yahdi","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"[for] them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمْ","en_gloss":"how many","transliteration":"kam","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَهْلَكْنَا","en_gloss":"We (have) destroyed","transliteration":"ahlaknā","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلَهُم","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"qablahum","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْقُرُونِ","en_gloss":"the generations","transliteration":"l-qurūni","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَمْشُونَ","en_gloss":"(as) they walk","transliteration":"yamshūna","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"their dwellings","transliteration":"masākinihim","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"surely (are) Signs","transliteration":"laāyātin","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لِّأُو۟لِى","en_gloss":"for possessors","transliteration":"li-ulī","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلنُّهَىٰ","en_gloss":"(of) intelligence","transliteration":"l-nuhā","verse_key":"20:128"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٢٨","en_gloss":"(128)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:128"}]},{"verse_key":"20:129","surah":20,"ayah":129,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَا كَلِمَةٌ سَبَقَتْ مِن رَّبِّكَ لَكَانَ لِزَامًا وَأَجَلٌ مُّسَمًّى","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If it were not for a preordained Word from your Lord [Prophet], they would already have been destroyed. Their time has been set,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْلَا","en_gloss":"And if not","transliteration":"walawlā","verse_key":"20:129"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَلِمَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(for) a Word","transliteration":"kalimatun","verse_key":"20:129"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَبَقَتْ","en_gloss":"(that) preceded","transliteration":"sabaqat","verse_key":"20:129"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"20:129"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"20:129"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكَانَ","en_gloss":"surely (would) have been","transliteration":"lakāna"